---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>리부트 컴퓨터 · 컴퓨터 수리·조립 (용산)</title>
  <meta name="description" content="용산 리부트 컴퓨터 — 컴퓨터 수리, 조립 PC 견적, 노트북 업그레이드. 빠르고 정직한 서비스." />
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Pixelify+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />
  <style>
    :root {
      --w95-teal: #008080;
      --w95-gray: #c0c0c0;
      --w95-gray-dark: #808080;
      --w95-gray-darker: #404040;
      --w95-white: #ffffff;
      --w95-navy: #000080;
      --w95-blue-light: #1084d0;
      --w95-black: #000000;
      --w95-text: #000000;
      --w95-yellow: #ffffcc;
      --w95-font: 'Tahoma', 'Pixelify Sans', 'Segoe UI', sans-serif;
      --w95-font-pixel: 'Pixelify Sans', 'Tahoma', sans-serif;
    }

    * { box-sizing: border-box; }

    html, body {
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
    }

    body {
      background: var(--w95-teal);
      font-family: var(--w95-font);
      font-size: 13px;
      color: var(--w95-text);
      min-height: 100vh;
      -webkit-font-smoothing: none;
      cursor: default;
    }

    /* ===== Bevel system ===== */
    /* Raised (out) — buttons, window bodies */
    .bevel-out {
      border-style: solid;
      border-width: 2px;
      border-color: var(--w95-white) var(--w95-gray-darker) var(--w95-gray-darker) var(--w95-white);
      box-shadow: inset 1px 1px 0 0 var(--w95-gray), inset -1px -1px 0 0 var(--w95-gray-dark);
    }
    /* Sunken (in) — input fields, content wells */
    .bevel-in {
      border-style: solid;
      border-width: 2px;
      border-color: var(--w95-gray-darker) var(--w95-white) var(--w95-white) var(--w95-gray-darker);
      box-shadow: inset 1px 1px 0 0 var(--w95-gray-dark), inset -1px -1px 0 0 var(--w95-gray);
    }

    /* ===== Desktop layout ===== */
    .desktop {
      padding: 64px 16px 64px;
      min-height: 100vh;
    }

    .desktop-inner {
      max-width: 940px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 28px;
    }

    /* ===== Window chrome ===== */
    .window {
      background: var(--w95-gray);
      padding: 3px;
    }

    .titlebar {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 6px;
      background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--w95-navy) 0%, var(--w95-blue-light) 100%);
      color: var(--w95-white);
      padding: 3px 3px 3px 6px;
      font-weight: 700;
      font-size: 12px;
      letter-spacing: 0.02em;
      user-select: none;
    }

    .titlebar-title {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 6px;
      white-space: nowrap;
      overflow: hidden;
      text-overflow: ellipsis;
    }

    .titlebar-icon {
      width: 16px;
      height: 16px;
      flex-shrink: 0;
    }

    .titlebar-buttons {
      display: flex;
      gap: 2px;
      flex-shrink: 0;
    }

    .tb-btn {
      width: 18px;
      height: 16px;
      background: var(--w95-gray);
      border-style: solid;
      border-width: 1px;
      border-color: var(--w95-white) var(--w95-gray-darker) var(--w95-gray-darker) var(--w95-white);
      color: var(--w95-black);
      font-family: var(--w95-font);
      font-size: 10px;
      font-weight: 700;
      line-height: 1;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      cursor: pointer;
      padding: 0;
    }
    .tb-btn:active {
      border-color: var(--w95-gray-darker) var(--w95-white) var(--w95-white) var(--w95-gray-darker);
    }

    .window-body {
      padding: 16px;
    }

    /* ===== Hero (desktop) ===== */
    .hero {
      text-align: center;
      padding: 8px 16px 24px;
    }

    .hero-icon {
      width: 88px;
      height: 88px;
      margin: 0 auto 14px;
      display: block;
    }

    .hero-title {
      font-family: var(--w95-font-pixel);
      color: var(--w95-white);
      font-size: clamp(34px, 7vw, 60px);
      font-weight: 700;
      margin: 0;
      line-height: 1.05;
      text-shadow: 2px 2px 0 rgba(0,0,0,0.45);
    }

    .hero-sub {
      color: var(--w95-yellow);
      font-size: clamp(13px, 2.4vw, 17px);
      margin: 10px auto 0;
      max-width: 540px;
      text-shadow: 1px 1px 0 rgba(0,0,0,0.4);
      letter-spacing: 0.02em;
    }

    .hero-actions {
      margin-top: 22px;
      display: flex;
      gap: 12px;
      justify-content: center;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
    }

    /* ===== Buttons ===== */
    .btn {
      background: var(--w95-gray);
      color: var(--w95-black);
      font-family: var(--w95-font);
      font-size: 13px;
      font-weight: 700;
      padding: 9px 20px;
      cursor: pointer;
      text-decoration: none;
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 8px;
      border-style: solid;
      border-width: 2px;
      border-color: var(--w95-white) var(--w95-gray-darker) var(--w95-gray-darker) var(--w95-white);
      box-shadow: inset 1px 1px 0 0 var(--w95-gray), inset -1px -1px 0 0 var(--w95-gray-dark);
      position: relative;
    }
    .btn:focus-visible {
      outline: 1px dotted var(--w95-black);
      outline-offset: -5px;
    }
    .btn:active {
      border-color: var(--w95-gray-darker) var(--w95-white) var(--w95-white) var(--w95-gray-darker);
      box-shadow: inset 1px 1px 0 0 var(--w95-gray-dark), inset -1px -1px 0 0 var(--w95-gray);
      padding: 10px 19px 8px 21px;
    }
    .btn-primary {
      font-family: var(--w95-font-pixel);
    }

    /* ===== Section heading inside window ===== */
    .section-lead {
      margin: 0 0 4px;
      font-size: 13px;
      color: var(--w95-gray-darker);
    }
    .section-lead strong { color: var(--w95-black); }

    /* ===== Services grid ===== */
    .svc-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
      gap: 14px;
      margin-top: 14px;
    }
    .svc-card {
      background: var(--w95-white);
      padding: 16px 14px;
    }
    .svc-card .svc-icon {
      width: 40px;
      height: 40px;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
    }
    .svc-card h3 {
      margin: 0 0 6px;
      font-size: 14px;
      font-weight: 700;
    }
    .svc-card p {
      margin: 0;
      font-size: 12px;
      line-height: 1.5;
      color: var(--w95-gray-darker);
    }

    /* ===== Price table (windowed list view) ===== */
    .price-toolbar {
      display: flex;
      gap: 8px;
      align-items: center;
      margin-bottom: 12px;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
    }
    .price-toolbar .tag {
      background: var(--w95-white);
      padding: 4px 10px;
      font-size: 11px;
    }
    .price-list {
      background: var(--w95-white);
    }
    table.price {
      width: 100%;
      border-collapse: collapse;
      font-size: 12px;
    }
    table.price thead th {
      background: var(--w95-gray);
      text-align: left;
      padding: 7px 10px;
      font-weight: 700;
      border-right: 1px solid var(--w95-gray-dark);
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--w95-gray-dark);
    }
    table.price thead th:last-child { border-right: none; text-align: right; }
    table.price tbody td {
      padding: 8px 10px;
      border-bottom: 1px solid #e4e4e4;
    }
    table.price tbody td:last-child {
      text-align: right;
      font-weight: 700;
      white-space: nowrap;
    }
    table.price tbody tr:nth-child(even) td { background: #f4f4f4; }
    table.price tbody tr:hover td { background: var(--w95-navy); color: var(--w95-white); }
    .price-note {
      margin: 12px 0 0;
      font-size: 11px;
      color: var(--w95-gray-darker);
    }

    /* ===== Reviews ===== */
    .review-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
      gap: 14px;
    }
    .review {
      background: var(--w95-yellow);
      padding: 14px;
    }
    .review .stars {
      color: #b8860b;
      font-size: 13px;
      letter-spacing: 2px;
      margin-bottom: 6px;
    }
    .review p {
      margin: 0 0 10px;
      font-size: 12px;
      line-height: 1.55;
    }
    .review .by {
      font-size: 11px;
      color: var(--w95-gray-darker);
      font-weight: 700;
    }

    /* ===== Contact ===== */
    .contact-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
      gap: 18px;
      align-items: start;
    }
    .field {
      margin-bottom: 12px;
    }
    .field label {
      display: block;
      font-size: 12px;
      margin-bottom: 4px;
      font-weight: 700;
    }
    .field input,
    .field textarea {
      width: 100%;
      font-family: var(--w95-font);
      font-size: 13px;
      padding: 6px 8px;
      background: var(--w95-white);
      color: var(--w95-black);
      border-style: solid;
      border-width: 2px;
      border-color: var(--w95-gray-darker) var(--w95-white) var(--w95-white) var(--w95-gray-darker);
    }
    .field input:focus,
    .field textarea:focus {
      outline: 1px dotted var(--w95-black);
      outline-offset: 1px;
    }
    .field textarea { resize: vertical; min-height: 84px; }

    .info-well {
      background: var(--w95-white);
      padding: 14px;
    }
    .info-row {
      display: flex;
      align-items: flex-start;
      gap: 10px;
      padding: 8px 0;
      border-bottom: 1px dotted var(--w95-gray-dark);
      font-size: 12px;
    }
    .info-row:last-child { border-bottom: none; }
    .info-row .ir-icon { width: 18px; height: 18px; flex-shrink: 0; margin-top: 1px; }
    .info-row .ir-label { font-weight: 700; min-width: 52px; }
    .info-row .ir-val { color: var(--w95-gray-darker); }
    .info-row strong { color: var(--w95-navy); font-size: 14px; }

    /* ===== Taskbar (start bar) ===== */
    .taskbar {
      position: fixed;
      bottom: 0;
      left: 0;
      right: 0;
      height: 36px;
      background: var(--w95-gray);
      border-top: 2px solid var(--w95-white);
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 8px;
      padding: 0 6px;
      z-index: 9000;
      user-select: none;
    }
    .start-btn {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 6px;
      font-family: var(--w95-font-pixel);
      font-weight: 700;
      font-size: 13px;
      padding: 4px 12px 4px 8px;
      background: var(--w95-gray);
      color: var(--w95-black);
      text-decoration: none;
      border-style: solid;
      border-width: 2px;
      border-color: var(--w95-white) var(--w95-gray-darker) var(--w95-gray-darker) var(--w95-white);
      box-shadow: inset 1px 1px 0 0 var(--w95-gray), inset -1px -1px 0 0 var(--w95-gray-dark);
    }
    .start-btn:active {
      border-color: var(--w95-gray-darker) var(--w95-white) var(--w95-white) var(--w95-gray-darker);
    }
    .start-btn .flag { width: 18px; height: 18px; }
    .task-divider { width: 2px; height: 22px; box-shadow: -1px 0 0 var(--w95-gray-dark), 1px 0 0 var(--w95-white); }
    .task-item {
      font-size: 12px;
      padding: 4px 10px;
      flex: 0 1 auto;
      max-width: 180px;
      white-space: nowrap;
      overflow: hidden;
      text-overflow: ellipsis;
      border-style: solid;
      border-width: 2px;
      border-color: var(--w95-gray-darker) var(--w95-white) var(--w95-white) var(--w95-gray-darker);
      background: #d8d8d8;
    }
    .tray {
      margin-left: auto;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 8px;
      font-size: 11px;
      padding: 4px 10px;
      border-style: solid;
      border-width: 2px;
      border-color: var(--w95-gray-darker) var(--w95-white) var(--w95-white) var(--w95-gray-darker);
    }

    /* ===== Responsive: stack windows vertically, simplify chrome ===== */
    @media (max-width: 720px) {
      .desktop { padding: 60px 10px 56px; }
      .desktop-inner { gap: 20px; }
      .svc-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .review-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .contact-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .window-body { padding: 12px; }
      .task-item { display: none; }
      table.price thead th,
      table.price tbody td { padding: 7px 7px; }
    }
    @media (max-width: 420px) {
      .hero-actions { flex-direction: column; align-items: stretch; }
      .btn { justify-content: center; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

<div style="position:fixed;top:0;left:0;right:0;z-index:9999;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:12px;padding:8px 16px;background:rgba(7,11,20,0.94);backdrop-filter:blur(8px);border-bottom:2px solid #ffb000;font-family:ui-monospace,'JetBrains Mono',monospace;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:0.08em;">
  <a href="/portfolio" style="color:#ffb000;text-decoration:none;white-space:nowrap;">← PORTFOLIO</a>
  <span style="color:#8ea0b8;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis;white-space:nowrap;">SAMPLE 24 · 리부트 컴퓨터 — Windows 95 UI 스타일</span>
  <a href="/contact" style="color:#070b14;background:#ffb000;padding:6px 12px;text-decoration:none;font-weight:700;white-space:nowrap;border-radius:2px;">제작 문의 →</a>
</div>
<div style="height:40px;"></div>

<main class="desktop">
  <div class="desktop-inner">

    <!-- ===== HERO (desktop) ===== -->
    <section class="hero" aria-labelledby="hero-heading">
      <!-- PC monitor icon -->
      <svg class="hero-icon" viewBox="0 0 48 48" role="img" aria-label="컴퓨터 아이콘" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" shape-rendering="crispEdges">
        <rect x="4" y="6" width="40" height="28" fill="#c0c0c0" stroke="#000" stroke-width="1"/>
        <rect x="7" y="9" width="34" height="22" fill="#008080"/>
        <rect x="9" y="11" width="14" height="2" fill="#00ffff"/>
        <rect x="9" y="15" width="22" height="2" fill="#ffffff"/>
        <rect x="9" y="19" width="18" height="2" fill="#ffffff"/>
        <rect x="9" y="23" width="10" height="2" fill="#ffff00"/>
        <rect x="18" y="34" width="12" height="5" fill="#a0a0a0" stroke="#000" stroke-width="1"/>
        <rect x="12" y="39" width="24" height="4" fill="#c0c0c0" stroke="#000" stroke-width="1"/>
      </svg>
      <h1 id="hero-heading" class="hero-title">리부트 컴퓨터</h1>
      <p class="hero-sub">용산 30년 노하우 · 컴퓨터가 멈췄을 때, 다시 켜 드립니다.<br>수리 · 조립 PC · 노트북 업그레이드 정직 견적</p>
      <div class="hero-actions">
        <a class="btn btn-primary" href="#contact">무료 견적 받기</a>
        <a class="btn" href="#price">수리 가격표 보기</a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ===== SERVICES WINDOW ===== -->
    <section class="window" aria-labelledby="svc-heading">
      <div class="titlebar">
        <span class="titlebar-title" id="svc-heading">
          <svg class="titlebar-icon" viewBox="0 0 16 16" shape-rendering="crispEdges" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="2" y="2" width="12" height="9" fill="#c0c0c0" stroke="#000"/><rect x="4" y="4" width="8" height="5" fill="#008080"/><rect x="5" y="12" width="6" height="2" fill="#808080" stroke="#000"/></svg>
          서비스 안내 - [내 컴퓨터]
        </span>
        <span class="titlebar-buttons">
          <button class="tb-btn" type="button" aria-label="최소화" tabindex="-1">_</button>
          <button class="tb-btn" type="button" aria-label="최대화" tabindex="-1">□</button>
          <button class="tb-btn" type="button" aria-label="닫기" tabindex="-1">✕</button>
        </span>
      </div>
      <div class="window-body">
        <p class="section-lead"><strong>무엇을 도와드릴까요?</strong> 진단은 항상 무료입니다. 고치지 못하면 비용을 받지 않습니다.</p>
        <div class="svc-grid">
          <div class="svc-card bevel-in">
            <svg class="svc-icon" viewBox="0 0 32 32" shape-rendering="crispEdges" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="4" y="6" width="24" height="16" fill="#c0c0c0" stroke="#000"/><rect x="7" y="9" width="18" height="10" fill="#000080"/><rect x="12" y="22" width="8" height="3" fill="#808080" stroke="#000"/><rect x="8" y="25" width="16" height="2" fill="#404040"/><rect x="20" y="11" width="4" height="4" fill="#ff0000"/></svg>
            <h3>데스크탑 수리</h3>
            <p>부팅 불가, 블루스크린, 발열·소음, 포맷·OS 재설치까지. 부품 교체 전 정확한 원인부터 잡습니다.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="svc-card bevel-in">
            <svg class="svc-icon" viewBox="0 0 32 32" shape-rendering="crispEdges" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="5" y="7" width="22" height="13" fill="#c0c0c0" stroke="#000"/><rect x="8" y="10" width="16" height="8" fill="#008080"/><rect x="3" y="20" width="26" height="3" fill="#808080" stroke="#000"/><rect x="13" y="20" width="6" height="2" fill="#404040"/></svg>
            <h3>노트북 업그레이드</h3>
            <p>SSD 교체, 메모리 증설, 쿨링팬 청소·서멀 재도포. 느려진 노트북을 새것처럼 되살립니다.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="svc-card bevel-in">
            <svg class="svc-icon" viewBox="0 0 32 32" shape-rendering="crispEdges" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="8" y="4" width="16" height="24" fill="#c0c0c0" stroke="#000"/><rect x="11" y="7" width="10" height="3" fill="#404040"/><rect x="11" y="12" width="10" height="3" fill="#404040"/><rect x="11" y="20" width="6" height="6" fill="#008080"/><rect x="18" y="20" width="3" height="3" fill="#00ff00"/></svg>
            <h3>맞춤 조립 PC</h3>
            <p>게임·사무·영상편집 용도와 예산을 말씀해 주시면 가성비 견적을 짜 드립니다. 1년 무상 A/S.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ===== PRICE WINDOW ===== -->
    <section class="window" id="price" aria-labelledby="price-heading">
      <div class="titlebar">
        <span class="titlebar-title" id="price-heading">
          <svg class="titlebar-icon" viewBox="0 0 16 16" shape-rendering="crispEdges" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="3" y="2" width="10" height="12" fill="#ffffcc" stroke="#000"/><rect x="5" y="5" width="6" height="1" fill="#000"/><rect x="5" y="8" width="6" height="1" fill="#000"/><rect x="5" y="11" width="4" height="1" fill="#000"/></svg>
          수리 가격표.txt - 메모장
        </span>
        <span class="titlebar-buttons">
          <button class="tb-btn" type="button" aria-label="최소화" tabindex="-1">_</button>
          <button class="tb-btn" type="button" aria-label="최대화" tabindex="-1">□</button>
          <button class="tb-btn" type="button" aria-label="닫기" tabindex="-1">✕</button>
        </span>
      </div>
      <div class="window-body">
        <div class="price-toolbar">
          <span class="tag bevel-in">정찰제 · 출장 가능</span>
          <span class="tag bevel-in">진단 무료</span>
          <span class="tag bevel-in">현금·카드 동일가</span>
        </div>
        <div class="price-list bevel-in">
          <table class="price">
            <thead>
              <tr><th>항목</th><th>내용</th><th>예상 비용</th></tr>
            </thead>
            <tbody>
              <tr><td>기본 진단</td><td>증상 점검 · 원인 분석</td><td>무료</td></tr>
              <tr><td>포맷 / OS 재설치</td><td>윈도우 설치 + 기본 드라이버</td><td>3만원~</td></tr>
              <tr><td>SSD 교체</td><td>500GB 기준 (부품 별도)</td><td>4만원~</td></tr>
              <tr><td>메모리 증설</td><td>장착 + 호환 점검</td><td>2만원~</td></tr>
              <tr><td>쿨링·청소</td><td>분해 청소 + 서멀 재도포</td><td>3.5만원~</td></tr>
              <tr><td>메인보드 수리</td><td>커패시터·포트 교체</td><td>5만원~</td></tr>
              <tr><td>조립 PC 공임</td><td>부품 조립 + 세팅 (부품 별도)</td><td>5만원~</td></tr>
              <tr><td>데이터 복구</td><td>상태에 따라 상담 후 책정</td><td>상담</td></tr>
            </tbody>
          </table>
        </div>
        <p class="price-note">※ 표시 금액은 공임 기준 예상가입니다. 부품 비용은 사양에 따라 달라지며, 작업 전 반드시 총 견적을 먼저 안내해 드립니다.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ===== REVIEWS WINDOW ===== -->
    <section class="window" aria-labelledby="rev-heading">
      <div class="titlebar">
        <span class="titlebar-title" id="rev-heading">
          <svg class="titlebar-icon" viewBox="0 0 16 16" shape-rendering="crispEdges" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="2" y="3" width="12" height="8" fill="#ffffff" stroke="#000"/><rect x="4" y="11" width="3" height="3" fill="#ffffff" stroke="#000"/><rect x="4" y="5" width="8" height="1" fill="#000"/><rect x="4" y="7" width="6" height="1" fill="#000"/></svg>
          손님 후기 - 방명록
        </span>
        <span class="titlebar-buttons">
          <button class="tb-btn" type="button" aria-label="최소화" tabindex="-1">_</button>
          <button class="tb-btn" type="button" aria-label="최대화" tabindex="-1">□</button>
          <button class="tb-btn" type="button" aria-label="닫기" tabindex="-1">✕</button>
        </span>
      </div>
      <div class="window-body">
        <div class="review-grid">
          <div class="review bevel-out">
            <div class="stars" aria-label="별점 5점">★★★★★</div>
            <p>부팅이 안 돼서 새로 사야 하나 했는데, 진단 받아보니 파워 문제였어요. 다른 데선 20만원 부르던 걸 부품값만 받고 고쳐주셨습니다.</p>
            <div class="by">— 김OO 님 / 사무용 PC</div>
          </div>
          <div class="review bevel-out">
            <div class="stars" aria-label="별점 5점">★★★★★</div>
            <p>5년 된 노트북에 SSD 달고 메모리 올렸더니 부팅 속도가 완전 달라졌어요. 작업 시간도 30분 만에 끝. 친절하게 설명해 주셔서 좋았습니다.</p>
            <div class="by">— 이OO 님 / 노트북 업그레이드</div>
          </div>
          <div class="review bevel-out">
            <div class="stars" aria-label="별점 5점">★★★★★</div>
            <p>게임용 조립 맡겼는데 예산 안에서 최적 사양으로 짜주셨어요. 선 정리까지 깔끔하고, 한 달 뒤 소음 문의했더니 바로 봐주셨습니다.</p>
            <div class="by">— 박OO 님 / 게이밍 조립</div>
          </div>
          <div class="review bevel-out">
            <div class="stars" aria-label="별점 4점">★★★★☆</div>
            <p>매장이 좀 찾기 어려웠지만 실력은 확실합니다. 발열로 자꾸 꺼지던 컴퓨터, 청소·서멀 작업 후로 멀쩡해졌어요. 정직하게 장사하시는 곳.</p>
            <div class="by">— 정OO 님 / 데스크탑 청소</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ===== CONTACT WINDOW ===== -->
    <section class="window" id="contact" aria-labelledby="contact-heading">
      <div class="titlebar">
        <span class="titlebar-title" id="contact-heading">
          <svg class="titlebar-icon" viewBox="0 0 16 16" shape-rendering="crispEdges" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="2" y="3" width="12" height="10" fill="#ffffff" stroke="#000"/><rect x="2" y="3" width="12" height="2" fill="#000080"/><path d="M3 5 L8 9 L13 5" fill="none" stroke="#000"/></svg>
