              </div>
              <div class="info-row">
                <svg class="ir-icon" viewBox="0 0 18 18" shape-rendering="crispEdges" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="9" cy="9" r="7" fill="#ffffcc" stroke="#000"/><path d="M9 5 v4 l3 2" fill="none" stroke="#000"/></svg>
                <span class="ir-label">영업</span>
                <span class="ir-val">평일 09:30 ~ 19:30 / 토 10:00 ~ 17:00<br>일요일·공휴일 휴무</span>
              </div>
              <div class="info-row">
                <svg class="ir-icon" viewBox="0 0 18 18" shape-rendering="crispEdges" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="3" y="3" width="12" height="12" fill="#fff" stroke="#000"/><rect x="3" y="3" width="12" height="3" fill="#000080"/><path d="M4 6 l5 4 5 -4" fill="none" stroke="#000"/></svg>
                <span class="ir-label">이메일</span>
                <span class="ir-val">help@reboot-pc.kr</span>
